[32m+[m[32m## Image Creation Workflow[m[41m[m
[32m+[m[41m[m
[32m+[m[32mUse the `/create-social-content` skill whenever a page needs a new marketing, hero, service, industry, campaign, social, banner, or share image. Use the local MCP `create_marketing_image` tool for still images. Read and follow `.github/skills/create-social-content/SKILL.md` before invoking the tool.[m[41m[m
[32m+[m[41m[m
[32m+[m[32mFor website photography and feature images:[m[41m[m
[32m+[m[41m[m
[32m+[m[32m- Prefer `format: "horizontal"` with a 16:9 composition for hero and service images. Create a separate 1200x630 social-share crop where needed.[m[41m[m
[32m+[m[32m- Prefer `outputFormat: "jpeg"` and a descriptive lowercase hyphenated filename ending in `.jpg` for photographic assets.[m[41m[m
[32m+[m[32m- Always pass `optimize: true`, `quality: "medium"` unless the task specifies otherwise, `outputFileName`, and `outputDirectory` when using the MCP tool.[m[41m[m
[32m+[m[32m- Use descriptive asset folders such as `assets/images/services/`, `assets/images/industries/`, or `assets/social/`; do not scatter generated files in the repository root.[m[41m[m
[32m+[m[32m- Review the generated image before publishing. Check visual accuracy, readable text, spelling, mobile crop, contrast, compression artifacts, dimensions, and file size.[m[41m[m
[32m+[m[32m- Add explicit `width` and `height` attributes in HTML. Use `fetchpriority="high"` only for the primary above-the-fold image and `loading="lazy"` for below-the-fold images.[m[41m[m
[32m+[m[32m- Use responsive image markup with `srcset` and `sizes` when multiple image sizes are available. Prefer WebP derivatives through `<picture>` when supported, with the optimized JPG as the fallback.[m[41m[m
[32m+[m[32m- Do not use generated images as a substitute for accessible HTML content. The page heading, caption, nearby text, and alt text must communicate the subject independently.[m[41m[m
[32m+[m[32m- Never generate or publish invented certification marks, partner logos, customer logos, UI screenshots containing false data, or misleading industrial equipment.[m[41m[m
[32m+[m[32m- Respect the service limit of 10 image creation calls per minute. For batches, group the requests deliberately and avoid parallel calls that could exceed the limit.[m[41m[m
